{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Mech Assembler, a relaxing puzzle game inspired by model kit building (Gunpla). You'll experience the tranquility of building a model kit, then painting it with Spry, using masking tape to avoid painting unwanted areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut, assemble, paint, and customize your models! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647660/extras/b578783f943d57afb3ef0654b9e19a60.poster.avif?t=1749004105\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647660/extras/b578783f943d57afb3ef0654b9e19a60.webm?t=1749004105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647660/extras/b578783f943d57afb3ef0654b9e19a60.mp4?t=1749004105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you complete a model kit, you earn points and in-game currency, which you can use to refill paint cans and unlock in-game items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All models and parts have been carefully designed for a relaxing experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3647660?t=1749004105","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3647660?t=1749004105","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647660/1c703c254cc3eae8b42aec6f89ec2e3a03b37def/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749004105","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647660/1c703c254cc3eae8b42aec6f89ec2e3a03b37def/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749004105","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3654870,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Mech Assembler, a relaxing puzzle game inspired by model kit building (Gunpla). You'll experience the tranquility of building a model kit, then painting it with Spry, using masking tape to avoid painting unwanted areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut, assemble, paint, and customize your models! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647660/extras/b578783f943d57afb3ef0654b9e19a60.poster.avif?t=1749004105\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647660/extras/b578783f943d57afb3ef0654b9e19a60.webm?t=1749004105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647660/extras/b578783f943d57afb3ef0654b9e19a60.mp4?t=1749004105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you complete a model kit, you earn points and in-game currency, which you can use to refill paint cans and unlock in-game items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All models and parts have been carefully designed for a relaxing experience.</p>","developers":["TurboPixeles"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647660/7433d9b974ab91abc9ae07a66209d4590407046d/header.jpg?t=1749004105","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3647660/415808208/5249b7feb4af932f91a62abd9c8dc7dd3fe584de/175